{"number":81,"nameArabic":"التكوير","nameTransliterated":"At-Takwir","nameTranslated":"The Overthrowing","revelationPlace":"makkah","versesCount":29,"verses":[{"ayah":1,"verseKey":"81:1","textAr":"إِذَا ٱلشَّمۡسُ كُوِّرَتۡ","transliteration":"Itha alshshamsu kuwwirat","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"When the sun is wrapped up [in darkness]"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"جب سورج لپیٹ دیا جائے گا"}]},{"ayah":2,"verseKey":"81:2","textAr":"وَإِذَا ٱلنُّجُومُ ٱنكَدَرَتۡ","transliteration":"Waitha alnnujoomu inkadarat","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And when the stars fall, dispersing"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور جب تارے بکھر جائیں گے"}]},{"ayah":3,"verseKey":"81:3","textAr":"وَإِذَا ٱلۡجِبَالُ سُيِّرَتۡ","transliteration":"Waitha aljibalu suyyirat","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And when the mountains are removed"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور جب پہاڑ چلائے جائیں گے"}]},{"ayah":4,"verseKey":"81:4","textAr":"وَإِذَا ٱلۡعِشَارُ عُطِّلَتۡ","transliteration":"Waitha alAAisharu AAuttilat","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And when full-term she-camels are neglected"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور جب دس مہینے کی حاملہ اونٹنیاں اپنے حال پر چھوڑ دی جائیں گی"}]},{"ayah":5,"verseKey":"81:5","textAr":"وَإِذَا ٱلۡوُحُوشُ حُشِرَتۡ","transliteration":"Waitha alwuhooshu hushirat","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And when the wild beasts are gathered"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور جب جنگلی جانور سمیٹ کر اکٹھے کر دیے جائیں گے"}]},{"ayah":6,"verseKey":"81:6","textAr":"وَإِذَا ٱلۡبِحَارُ سُجِّرَتۡ","transliteration":"Waitha albiharu sujjirat","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And when the seas are filled with flame"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور جب سمندر بھڑکا دیے جائیں گے"}]},{"ayah":7,"verseKey":"81:7","textAr":"وَإِذَا ٱلنُّفُوسُ زُوِّجَتۡ","transliteration":"Waitha alnnufoosu zuwwijat","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And when the souls are paired"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور جب جانیں (جسموں سے) جوڑ دی جائیں گی"}]},{"ayah":8,"verseKey":"81:8","textAr":"وَإِذَا ٱلۡمَوۡءُۥدَةُ سُئِلَتۡ","transliteration":"Waitha almawoodatu suilat","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And when the girl [who was] buried alive is asked"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور جب زندہ گاڑی ہوئی لڑکی سے پوچھا جائے گا"}]},{"ayah":9,"verseKey":"81:9","textAr":"بِأَيِّ ذَنۢبٖ قُتِلَتۡ","transliteration":"Biayyi thanbin qutilat","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"For what sin she was killed"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"کہ وہ کس قصور میں ماری گئی؟"}]},{"ayah":10,"verseKey":"81:10","textAr":"وَإِذَا ٱلصُّحُفُ نُشِرَتۡ","transliteration":"Waitha alssuhufu nushirat","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And when the pages are made public"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور جب اعمال نامے کھولے جائیں گے"}]},{"ayah":11,"verseKey":"81:11","textAr":"وَإِذَا ٱلسَّمَآءُ كُشِطَتۡ","transliteration":"Waitha alssamao kushitat","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And when the sky is stripped away"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور جب آسمان کا پردہ ہٹا دیا جائے گا"}]},{"ayah":12,"verseKey":"81:12","textAr":"وَإِذَا ٱلۡجَحِيمُ سُعِّرَتۡ","transliteration":"Waitha aljaheemu suAAAAirat","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And when Hellfire is set ablaze"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور جب جہنم دہکائی جائے گی"}]},{"ayah":13,"verseKey":"81:13","textAr":"وَإِذَا ٱلۡجَنَّةُ أُزۡلِفَتۡ","transliteration":"Waitha aljannatu ozlifat","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And when Paradise is brought near"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور جب جنت قریب لے آئی جائے گی"}]},{"ayah":14,"verseKey":"81:14","textAr":"عَلِمَتۡ نَفۡسٞ مَّآ أَحۡضَرَتۡ","transliteration":"AAalimat nafsun ma ahdarat","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"A soul will [then] know what it has brought [with it]"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اُس وقت ہر شخص کو معلوم ہو جائے گا کہ وہ کیا لے کر آیا ہے"}]},{"ayah":15,"verseKey":"81:15","textAr":"فَلَآ أُقۡسِمُ بِٱلۡخُنَّسِ","transliteration":"Fala oqsimu bialkhunnasi","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"So I swear by the retreating stars"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"پس نہیں، میں قسم کھاتا ہوں"}]},{"ayah":16,"verseKey":"81:16","textAr":"ٱلۡجَوَارِ ٱلۡكُنَّسِ","transliteration":"Aljawari alkunnasi","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Those that run [their courses] and disappear"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"پلٹنے اور چھپ جانے والے تاروں کی"}]},{"ayah":17,"verseKey":"81:17","textAr":"وَٱلَّيۡلِ إِذَا عَسۡعَسَ","transliteration":"Waallayli itha AAasAAasa","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And by the night as it closes in"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور رات کی جبکہ وہ رخصت ہوئی"}]},{"ayah":18,"verseKey":"81:18","textAr":"وَٱلصُّبۡحِ إِذَا تَنَفَّسَ","transliteration":"Waalssubhi itha tanaffasa","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And by the dawn when it breathes"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور صبح کی جبکہ اس نے سانس لیا"}]},{"ayah":19,"verseKey":"81:19","textAr":"إِنَّهُۥ لَقَوۡلُ رَسُولٖ كَرِيمٖ","transliteration":"Innahu laqawlu rasoolin kareemin","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"[That] indeed, the Qur'an is a word [conveyed by] a noble messenger"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"یہ فی الواقع ایک بزرگ پیغام بر کا قول ہے"}]},{"ayah":20,"verseKey":"81:20","textAr":"ذِي قُوَّةٍ عِندَ ذِي ٱلۡعَرۡشِ مَكِينٖ","transliteration":"Thee quwwatin AAinda thee alAAarshi makeenin","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"[Who is] possessed of power and with the Owner of the Throne, secure [in position]"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"جو بڑی توانائی رکھتا ہے، عرش والے کے ہاں بلند مرتبہ ہے"}]},{"ayah":21,"verseKey":"81:21","textAr":"مُّطَاعٖ ثَمَّ أَمِينٖ","transliteration":"MutaAAin thamma ameenin","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Obeyed there [in the heavens] and trustworthy"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"وہاں اُس کا حکم مانا جاتا ہے، وہ با اعتماد ہے"}]},{"ayah":22,"verseKey":"81:22","textAr":"وَمَا صَاحِبُكُم بِمَجۡنُونٖ","transliteration":"Wama sahibukum bimajnoonin","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And your companion is not [at all] mad"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور (اے اہل مکہ) تمہارا رفیق مجنون نہیں ہے"}]},{"ayah":23,"verseKey":"81:23","textAr":"وَلَقَدۡ رَءَاهُ بِٱلۡأُفُقِ ٱلۡمُبِينِ","transliteration":"Walaqad raahu bialofuqi almubeeni","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And he has already seen Gabriel in the clear horizon"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اُس نے اُس پیغام بر کو روشن افق پر دیکھا ہے"}]},{"ayah":24,"verseKey":"81:24","textAr":"وَمَا هُوَ عَلَى ٱلۡغَيۡبِ بِضَنِينٖ","transliteration":"Wama huwa AAala alghaybi bidaneenin","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And Muhammad is not a withholder of [knowledge of] the unseen"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور وہ غیب (کے اِس علم کو لوگوں تک پہنچانے) کے معاملے میں بخیل نہیں ہے"}]},{"ayah":25,"verseKey":"81:25","textAr":"وَمَا هُوَ بِقَوۡلِ شَيۡطَٰنٖ رَّجِيمٖ","transliteration":"Wama huwa biqawli shaytanin rajeemin","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And the Qur'an is not the word of a devil, expelled [from the heavens]"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور یہ کسی شیطان مردود کا قول نہیں ہے"}]},{"ayah":26,"verseKey":"81:26","textAr":"فَأَيۡنَ تَذۡهَبُونَ","transliteration":"Faayna tathhaboona","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"So where are you going"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"پھر تم لوگ کدھر چلے جا رہے ہو؟"}]},{"ayah":27,"verseKey":"81:27","textAr":"إِنۡ هُوَ إِلَّا ذِكۡرٞ لِّلۡعَٰلَمِينَ","transliteration":"In huwa illa thikrun lilAAalameena","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"It is not except a reminder to the worlds"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"یہ تو سارے جہان والوں کے لیے ایک نصیحت ہے"}]},{"ayah":28,"verseKey":"81:28","textAr":"لِمَن شَآءَ مِنكُمۡ أَن يَسۡتَقِيمَ","transliteration":"Liman shaa minkum an yastaqeema","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"For whoever wills among you to take a right course"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"تم میں سے ہر اُس شخص کے لیے جو راہ راست پر چلنا چاہتا ہو"}]},{"ayah":29,"verseKey":"81:29","textAr":"وَمَا تَشَآءُونَ إِلَّآ أَن يَشَآءَ ٱللَّهُ رَبُّ ٱلۡعَٰلَمِينَ","transliteration":"Wama tashaoona illa an yashaa Allahu rabbu alAAalameena","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And you do not will except that Allah wills - Lord of the worlds"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور تمہارے چاہنے سے کچھ نہیں ہوتا جب تک اللہ رب العالمین نہ چاہے"}]}]}